title: Included figures
summary: Figures in included text are numbered with the document's own, can be referenced from both sides, and lose to a figure of the document that gives the same id, so figure numbering and references stay as they are when they are refactored.
status: draft
---

## Overview

The flow is :ref[fig-flow], the included table is :ref[tbl-plans], the included diagram is :ref[fig-states] and the
listing after the include is :ref[lst-call]. :ref[fig-shared] is given on both sides.

